Subject: Format/STEP.hpp without OpenCASCADE

Model.hpp includes Format/STEP.hpp, which includes the OpenCASCADE headers. orca_core does not build the CAD kernel, so with
ORCA_CORE_SLICING_ONLY defined the header keeps only a forward declaration of class Step; everything that needs OpenCASCADE
(the includes, NamedSolid, the progress indicator, class Step) stays as Orca has it when the symbol is not defined.
Orca Slicer v2.5.2, commit f92a7c065c5718b8ef1baac1cd704df2911238f4.

